---
source: crates/terminal/tests/frames.rs
expression: "frame_of(\"styles\", 40, 3)"
---
size 40x3  colors fg #e5e5e5 bg #101010 cursor #ffffff
cursor 0,2 Block
scroll 0/3  modes Modes { bracketed_paste: false, mouse_tracking: false, alt_screen: false, focus_events: false }
 0: "bold italic faint strike"
      0..4   fg #e5e5e5 bold
      4..5   fg #e5e5e5
      5..11  fg #e5e5e5 italic
     11..12  fg #e5e5e5
     12..17  fg #e5e5e5 faint
     17..18  fg #e5e5e5
     18..24  fg #e5e5e5 strike
     24..40  fg #e5e5e5
 1: "single curly double over hide"
      0..6   fg #e5e5e5 underline Single
      6..7   fg #e5e5e5
      7..12  fg #e5e5e5 underline Curly #00ff00
     12..13  fg #e5e5e5
     13..19  fg #e5e5e5 underline Double
     19..20  fg #e5e5e5
     20..24  fg #e5e5e5 overline
     24..25  fg #e5e5e5
     25..29  fg #e5e5e5 invisible
     29..40  fg #e5e5e5
 2: ""
      0..40  fg #e5e5e5
